Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos13
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos13)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos13)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos13).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos13 adds laptop hardware on frozen lcos12: Intel pinctrl, LPSS,
 DesignWare I2C, and serdev; UART Bluetooth; Intel SOF and AMD ACP
 machine drivers; USB Ethernet; Realtek card readers; a short
 hwmon/idle set; IWLMLD; in-tree Surface Aggregator; vendor hotkeys.
 Rust left off (No Forced Rust). No Rust Android binder.
 .
 LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12; that config stays frozen.
 This package is the lcos13 revision of the same linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke
 name. On earlier LCOS releases that still ship a Distro kernel,
 installing this metapackage adds a GRUB entry alongside it.
